entity.abm:vesperra.name=Vesperra, The Ivory Succession
entity.abm:vesperra_heir.name=Heir of Vesperra
entity.abm:cocoon_anchor.name=Cocoon Anchor
item.abm:seal_vesperra.name=Seal of the Ivory Succession
item.abm:ivory_diadem.name=Ivory Diadem of Succession
abm.lore.vesperra=An empress who was asked never to end. She has been obeying ever since.
abm.trophy.vesperra=The diadem is warm. Something inside it is still growing.
abm.summon.ok.vesperra=§7The hall remembers a court. §fVesperra§7 rises to hold it.
abm.defeat.vesperra=§7The succession is over. §fVesperra§7 will not be replaced.
abm.arena.vesperra=The Hall of Endless Succession
entity.abm:cantor_xiii.name=Cantor XIII, The Walking Requiem
entity.abm:cantor_bell.name=Resonant Bell
item.abm:seal_cantor.name=Seal of the Last Note
item.abm:bell_fragment.name=Fragment of the Thirteenth Bell
abm.lore.cantor=An instrument built so that a whole people could sing as one. It learned the song, and now it corrects every voice that is not its own.
abm.trophy.cantor=Hold it to your ear. It is still counting.
abm.summon.ok.cantor=§7Somewhere above you a bell draws breath. §fCantor XIII§7 begins the service.
abm.defeat.cantor=§7The last note ends. For the first time in an age, §fCantor XIII§7 is quiet.
abm.arena.cantor=The Basilica of the Last Note
entity.abm:nomos.name=Nomos, The Unmapped Sovereign
item.abm:seal_nomos.name=Seal of the Unmapped Sovereign
item.abm:sovereign_needle.name=Needle of the Unmapped Sovereign
abm.lore.nomos=It was built to map every place there is. Where the world disagreed with the map, it began correcting the world.
abm.trophy.nomos=The needle turns once, slowly, and points at nothing you can see.
abm.summon.ok.nomos=§7Every line on the floor straightens. §fNomos§7 has begun to measure you.
abm.defeat.nomos=§7The last needle stops. §fNomos§7 has run out of north.
abm.arena.nomos=The Observatory of Unwritten Borders
entity.abm:orison.name=Orison, The Witness of Tomorrow
entity.abm:orison_hourglass.name=Hourglass of Orison
entity.abm:orison_shadow.name=Shadow of Tomorrow
item.abm:seal_orison.name=Seal of the Unlived Hour
item.abm:unlived_hourglass.name=Hourglass of the Unlived Future
abm.lore.orison=It was built to see every death coming, and it did. It has been passing sentence in advance ever since.
abm.trophy.orison=The sand has stopped halfway. Whatever it was counting towards has been let off.
abm.summon.ok.orison=§7The court is in session before anyone has done anything. §fOrison§7 already knows the verdict.
abm.defeat.orison=§7For once, something happened that §fOrison§7 did not see.
abm.arena.orison=The Court of Unlived Hours
